---
title: "supplyTokens (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: projectAdmin calls supplyTokens()
    q_check_auth --> q_error_auth: caller is not projectAdmin
    q_error_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_results: caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_results --> q_error_results: resultsAlreadyPublished == false
    q_error_results --> [*]: revert ResultsNotPublished
    q_check_results --> q_check_supplied: resultsAlreadyPublished == true
    q_check_supplied --> q_error_supplied: tokensAlreadySupplied == true
    q_error_supplied --> [*]: revert TokensAlreadySupplied
    q_check_supplied --> q_calc_total: tokensAlreadySupplied == false
    q_calc_total --> q_transfer: requiredAmount = totalTokensAllocated + tokenFees
    q_transfer --> q_set_state: transferFrom(projectAdmin, address(this), requiredAmount) in askToken
    q_set_state --> q_emit: tokensAlreadySupplied = true
    q_emit --> [*]: emit TokensSupplied(requiredAmount)

    note right of q_calc_total
        INV-001: Token supply happens exactly once
        INV-002: requiredAmount includes allocated tokens plus distribution fees
        INV-003: Token supply requires results to be published first (askToken must be set)
        INV-004: Ordering: publishSaleResults() -> supplyTokens() -> claimTokenAllocation()
    end note
